0],[1,0,0,0,[12],[[0,[1]],[1,[0]],[2,[1]]],0]]],["DRAVOGRAD","administrative unit","PU CELJE",[[0,0,0,0,[14,21],[[0,[1,1]],[1,[0,0]],[2,[1,1]]],0],[5,0,0,0,[14],[[0,[1]],[1,[0]],[2,[1]]],0],[1,0,0,0,[14,21],[[0,[2,1]],[1,[0,0]],[2,[2,1]]],0]]],["SLOVENSKA BISTRICA","administrative unit","PU CELJE",[[2,0,0,0,[14],[[0,[1]],[1,[0]],[2,[1]]],0]]],["NI PODATKA","administrative unit","NI PODATKA",[[0,0,0,0,[16,17,18,19,21],[[0,[0,2,1,1,1]],[1,[1,0,0,0,0]],[2,[1,2,1,1,1]]],0],[5,0,0,0,[16,20],[[0,[0,1]],[1,[1,0]],[2,[1,1]]],0],[1,0,0,0,[16,17,18,19,20,21],[[0,[0,2,1,1,1,1]],[1,[2,0,0,0,0,0]],[2,[2,2,1,1,1,1]]],0],[2,0,0,0,[17],[[0,[1]],[1,[0]],[2,[1]]],0]]],["NI PODATKA","police directorate","",[[0,0,0,0,[16,17,18,19,21],[[0,[0,2,1,1,1]],[1,[1,0,0,0,0]],[2,[1,2,1,1,1]]],0],[5,0,0,0,[16,20],[[0,[0,1]],[1,[1,0]],[2,[1,1]]],0],[1,0,0,0,[16,17,18,19,20,21],[[0,[0,2,1,1,1,1]],[1,[2,0,0,0,0,0]],[2,[2,2,1,1,1,1]]],0],[2,0,0,0,[17],[[0,[1]],[1,[0]],[2,[1]]],0]]]]},"rows":7338,"sources":{"policija_kd":{"name":"Policija (Slovenian Police) - Kriminaliteta: statistični podatki v csv obliki (annual micro-data files kd2001.zip ... kd2024.zip)","publisher":"Republika Slovenija, Ministrstvo za notranje zadeve in javno upravo, Policija","url":"https://www.policija.si/o-slovenski-policiji/statistika/kriminaliteta","file_urls":"https://www.policija.si/baza/kd2001.zip through https://www.policija.si/baza/kd2024.zip (one zip per year; 2001-2007 contain KDINTKD.txt + šifranti.txt, 2008 DOGODKI.TXT + SIFRANTI.TXT, 2009-2024 kdYYYY.csv)","instructions_url":"https://www.policija.si/o-slovenski-policiji/statistika/kriminaliteta/kriminaliteta-statistika-navodila","licence":"no licence stated","years":"2001-2024","notes":"Record-level files of every criminal offence for which the police filed a criminal complaint or report, with the year of the concluding document (LetoZakljucnegaDokumenta) as the file year. Each file has one row per person involved, so offences were de-duplicated on ZaporednaStevilkaKD. Rows selected by OpisKD text: 'UMOR' (murder, KZ-1 art. 116 / KZ art. 127), 'UBOJ' (manslaughter, KZ-1 art. 115), 'UBOJ NA MAH' (art. 117 / KZ art. 128), 'DETOMOR' (infanticide, KZ art. 130, pre-2008 code only), 'POVZROČITEV SMRTI IZ MALOMARNOSTI' (negligent homicide, art. 118 / KZ art. 129). Attempts are flagged by the Poskus field (DA/D) and given as Completed, Attempted, and Completed + attempted. Areas: PU storitve (police directorate where committed: PU Celje, Koper, Kranj, Ljubljana, Maribor, Murska Sobota, Nova Gorica, Novo Mesto; plus the former PU Krško, PU Postojna, PU Slovenj Gradec until 2010-2011, and GPU/MNZ/NI PODATKA/code 000 for offences not assigned to a directorate) and Upravna enota (administrative unit, 58 units, with the police directorate as parent). Pre-2009 files give codes that were decoded with the šifranti.txt code list shipped in each zip. Extracted with python csv module; script at /tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/98c1a0c8-be55-5a6a-907a-bd7768dfbf58/scratchpad/svn_extract.py (copy in problems.md)."}},"dict":{"b":["Completed","Attempted","Completed + attempted"],"m":["Police-recorded criminal offences: Umor (murder)","Police-recorded criminal offences: Intentional homicide (umor + uboj + uboj na mah + detomor)","Police-recorded criminal offences: Povzrocitev smrti iz malomarnosti (negligent homicide)","Police-recorded criminal offences: Detomor (infanticide)","Police-recorded criminal offences: Uboj na mah (voluntary manslaughter in the heat of passion)","Police-recorded criminal offences: Uboj (manslaughter)"],"u":["count"],"s":["policija_kd"],"c":["2001","2002","2003","2004","2005","2006","2007","2008","2009","2010","2011","2012","2013","2014","2015","2016","2017","2018","2019","2020","2021","2022","2023","2024"]},"problems":"# Slovenia (SVN) - sub-national homicide\n\n## What was found\nThe Slovenian Police publish full record-level crime files (every criminal offence with a police complaint/report) for each year 2001-2024 at https://www.policija.si/o-slovenski-policiji/statistika/kriminaliteta (\"Statistični podatki v csv obliki\", files /baza/kdYYYY.zip). Fields include the police directorate (PU) where the offence was committed, the administrative unit (upravna enota), the offence article/description, and whether it was an attempt. From these, rows.csv aggregates homicide offences by police directorate and by administrative unit (parent = PU), plus a country total, for every year 2001-2024.\n\n## Caveats\n- The year is the year of the police concluding document, not the year of the act (the instructions page says this). A 2024 file contains some acts from earlier years.\n- The counts are offences (one ZaporednaStevilkaKD per offence), not victims. A double murder may be one offence.\n- \"Completed\" = Poskus field NE/N; \"Attempted\" = DA/D. Both are given, plus the sum. The police's own annual reports count umor+uboj including attempts.\n- Pre-2008 Criminal Code (KZ, 1995) had \"umor\" (art. 127) covering what KZ-1 (2008) splits into \"uboj\" (art. 115) and \"umor\" (art. 116). So the 2001-2008 \"Umor\" category corresponds to the later Umor+Uboj. The summary line \"Intentional homicide (umor + uboj + uboj na mah + detomor)\" is my sum across those labels, so it is comparable across the code change. Negligent homicide (art. 118/129) is given separately and not included in it.\n- Police directorates were reorganised: PU Krško, PU Postojna and PU Slovenj Gradec existed until 2011 (merged into Novo Mesto/Koper/Celje). Codes \"GPU\", \"MNZ (ZA STATISTIKO R SLOVENIJA)\", \"NI PODATKA\" and \"PU code 000\" are offences not attributed to a directorate; they are kept as published.\n- Only areas with at least one matching offence in a year have a row (zero rows are not generated).\n- Encoding of the source files is cp1250; a few 2006-2007 labels have mojibake in the source (e.g. \"POVZRO¬ITEV\") - matching used the stem \"SMRTI\" + \"MALOMARNO\" so those are still captured.\n- No licence statement was found on the statistics pages (checked the kriminaliteta page, the navodila page and the statistika page; none mention a licence or Creative Commons).\n\n## Not used / other sources\n- SURS SiStat (pxweb.stat.si) justice tables (searched the data service with \"kazniva\", \"umor\", \"regij kazniva dejanja\") are for Slovenia as a whole (convicted persons, prosecutions) with no regional dimension.\n- policija.si annual reports \"Poročilo o delu policije za leto YYYY\" (2010-2025, PDF/Word) also contain tables of umor/uboj by police directorate; not extracted because the CSV micro-data covers the same and more. policija.si was intermittently timing out (connection resets) during this session.","unmatched":95,"shapes":{}}